script CliffCave_EventScript_PokefanM {
    simplenpcmsg("If you see a fork in the road inside\n"
                 "a cave, most likely one way is right and\f"
                 "the other leads to a dead end.\f"
                 "But people can’t help trying both.\r"
                 "Do you want to go up the ladder\n"
                 "or go down the ladder?")
